s7-6-p28 = prose (cons "This schematic notation uses the guarded constructor's delayed continuation; it does not eliminate an arbitrary later value. An invalid instruction, trap, or resource failure is a distinct terminal observation or environmental command according to the *selected target semantics*, not an unmentioned fourth case. A source-command handler has the dependent type \(h:\prod_{c:\mathsf{Cmd}(\Sigma_{\mathrm{src}})}\mathsf{Proc}_{\Sigma_{\mathrm{sys}}}(\mathsf{Resp}(\Sigma_{\mathrm{src}},c))\): it interprets each source command as a system process returning that command's response type. Its extension \(h^*\) to source processes is the guarded version of the handler composition already defined above." nil)
